@HostAddress = http://localhost:5210

### Create a sample (201 Created, or 409 Conflict if the email is already in use)
# @name createSample
POST {{HostAddress}}/Sample
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sample one",
  "email": "sample.one@example.com"
}

### Get the sample just created (200 OK, or 404 Not Found)
GET {{HostAddress}}/Sample/{{createSample.response.body.$.id}}
Accept: application/json

### Readiness: runs every check, including the database (200, or 503 when unhealthy)
GET {{HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Liveness: runs no checks (200 whenever the process can serve requests)
GET {{HostAddress}}/health/live
Accept: application/json
